Description: 4k intro for Linux by MacSlow, released in 2019
 Mind your head is a 4k intro for Linux 64-bit by MacSlow, using SDL 2 and
 OpenGL 4. It was released at Revision 2019 (PC 4k intro compo, 13th place).
 .
 It runs fullscreen at 1920x1080, has no sound and quits by itself after
 about 90 seconds, or with the Escape key. A dedicated GPU is recommended.
